{"ok":true,"data":[{"id":"cmsps3k58001bimmxspsltodk","slug":"chatgpt-vs-claude","title":"ChatGPT vs Claude: Which AI Assistant Should You Use?","summary":"A side-by-side look at ChatGPT and Claude across reasoning, writing, coding and pricing.","toolAId":"cmsps3k2y000nimmxfynpaoff","toolBId":"cmsps3k3s000rimmx7uyimd74","winnerToolId":null,"featureTable":[{"toolA":"128K tokens","toolB":"200K tokens","feature":"Context window"},{"toolA":"Custom GPTs and integrations","toolB":"Projects and Artifacts","feature":"Ecosystem"},{"toolA":"Free / $20 mo","toolB":"Free / $20 mo","feature":"Starting price"}],"verdict":"<p>Both are excellent general-purpose assistants. Choose ChatGPT if you want a broad ecosystem and strong multimodal features; choose Claude if you work with very long documents and prefer structured writing.</p>","faq":[{"answer":"Yes. Many teams use both assistants side by side for different workflows.","question":"Can I use both ChatGPT and Claude?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-13T22:21:43.342Z","createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.244Z","toolA":{"id":"cmsps3k2y000nimmxfynpaoff","slug":"chatgpt","name":"ChatGPT","logoUrl":null,"description":"General-purpose AI assistant for writing, research, coding, analysis, and everyday productivity.","websiteUrl":"https://chatgpt.com","pricing":"Free / Paid","rating":4.6,"pros":["Extremely versatile","Strong reasoning and coding support","Large plugin/GPT ecosystem"],"cons":["Can be verbose","Usage limits on free tier"],"bestFor":"General-purpose assistance and research","features":["Web browsing","Code interpreter","Custom GPTs","Voice mode"],"affiliateUrl":null,"affiliateDisclosure":"Some links to tools on this page are affiliate links. If you buy through them, NEXORA may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. See our affiliate disclosure for details.","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.152Z","featured":true,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.162Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-13T22:21:43.322Z","categoryId":"cmsps3k23000himmx4bb41u3l"},"toolB":{"id":"cmsps3k3s000rimmx7uyimd74","slug":"claude","name":"Claude","logoUrl":null,"description":"AI assistant focused on reasoning, long-context work, writing, analysis, and coding.","websiteUrl":"https://claude.ai","pricing":"Free / Paid","rating":4.5,"pros":["Excellent long-document handling","Thoughtful, structured responses"],"cons":["Fewer third-party integrations than ChatGPT"],"bestFor":"Long-form analysis and document review","features":["200K+ token context","Projects","Artifacts"],"affiliateUrl":null,"affiliateDisclosure":"Some links to tools on this page are affiliate links. If you buy through them, NEXORA may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. See our affiliate disclosure for details.","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.186Z","featured":true,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.192Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-13T22:21:43.334Z","categoryId":"cmsps3k23000himmx4bb41u3l"}},{"id":"cmsra3rbd001ld28zqichzb7g","slug":"claude-vs-perplexity","title":"Claude vs Perplexity: Writing Assistant or Research Engine?","summary":"Compare Claude and Perplexity for research, writing, document analysis, citations, and everyday knowledge work.","toolAId":"cmsps3k3s000rimmx7uyimd74","toolBId":"cmsr9uyrh001b18sjru4tw51q","winnerToolId":null,"featureTable":[{"toolA":"Excellent","toolB":"Strong","feature":"Long-form writing"},{"toolA":"Excellent","toolB":"Strong","feature":"Deep document analysis"},{"toolA":"Limited","toolB":"Excellent","feature":"Real-time web research"},{"toolA":"Workflow dependent","toolB":"Excellent","feature":"Source citations"},{"toolA":"Excellent","toolB":"Strong","feature":"Reasoning"},{"toolA":"Strong","toolB":"Excellent","feature":"Research workflow"}],"verdict":"<p>Claude is the stronger choice when the primary job is thinking,\n        writing, and synthesizing large amounts of information. Perplexity\n        is better suited to research workflows where current web information\n        and visible source citations are central to the task.</p>","faq":[{"answer":"Not completely. The two products optimize for different workflows and can be complementary.","question":"Can Perplexity replace Claude?"},{"answer":"Perplexity has a strong advantage when current web information and source citations are essential.","question":"Which is better for research?"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-13T09:15:34.428Z","createdAt":"2026-08-13T08:51:13.800Z","toolA":{"id":"cmsps3k3s000rimmx7uyimd74","slug":"claude","name":"Claude","logoUrl":null,"description":"AI assistant focused on reasoning, long-context work, writing, analysis, and coding.","websiteUrl":"https://claude.ai","pricing":"Free / Paid","rating":4.5,"pros":["Excellent long-document handling","Thoughtful, structured responses"],"cons":["Fewer third-party integrations than ChatGPT"],"bestFor":"Long-form analysis and document review","features":["200K+ token context","Projects","Artifacts"],"affiliateUrl":null,"affiliateDisclosure":"Some links to tools on this page are affiliate links. If you buy through them, NEXORA may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. See our affiliate disclosure for details.","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.186Z","featured":true,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T07:39:25.192Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-13T22:21:43.334Z","categoryId":"cmsps3k23000himmx4bb41u3l"},"toolB":{"id":"cmsr9uyrh001b18sjru4tw51q","slug":"perplexity","name":"Perplexity","logoUrl":null,"description":"AI-powered research and search platform that combines web retrieval with synthesized answers and citations.","websiteUrl":"https://www.perplexity.ai","pricing":"Free / Pro","rating":null,"pros":[],"cons":[],"bestFor":null,"features":[],"affiliateUrl":null,"affiliateDisclosure":null,"lastReviewedAt":null,"featured":true,"createdAt":"2026-08-13T08:44:23.549Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-13T09:15:34.389Z","categoryId":"cmsr9uyr0001418sj084qzw3k"}}]}